Ni2             -0.5000000000        1.5000000000       -0.5000000000
O                0.7500000023       -0.2499999977       -0.2499999977
O               -0.7500000023        0.2499999977        0.2499999977

! High-symmetry path using crystal coordinates (crystal_b)
